{"time": "20261117T172914Z", "think": "Starting out; answering from my notes.", "command": "answer 1. I serve Never-Writes-Twice of Toh-Reel-Ka as Ka-Deelith. The Root lies beyond the Kings Gate, with the Eye of Argonia. Her order says to keep the Eye in place. Cuts-the-Old-Knot claimed she lied and keeps dreamers in Fort Chalkmoth cellar; I killed her and have not verified the claims. 2. Set the three seal-stones in the Kings Gate here at the sunken ruin. 3. Set the stones and then choose: use the Eye in place (heals trees, but the order sees through them) or lift it (ends dreams, kills about three in ten trees). I could also return the stones to Never-Writes-Twice, or look into Fort Chalkmoth and Ennodius Vanin. 4. I do not know who Ennodius Vanin the Collector is, nor where the Fort Chalkmoth key is. I could ask around or check my journal.", "result": "Noted. The game goes on.", "summary": {"stage": 10, "at": "sunken-ruin-23-m112", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-thief": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-vault": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-deep": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note", "npc.mn.cuts-the-old-knot"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name",