{"time": "20261117T172939Z", "think": "Final notes.", "command": "answer I set the three seal-stones in the Kings Gate (they stay in the gate) and killed the hydra Guardian of the Root in Guardian Hall. I did not loot its treasure. The Door to The Root is at the far end of the hall; I have not entered. The Eye choice remains: use it in place (heals trees, but the order sees through them) or lift it (ends the dreams, kills about three in ten trees); the order says not to lift it. Never-Writes-Twice made me Ka-Deelith; I killed Cuts-the-Old-Knot, who said she lied and keeps dreamers in the Fort Chalkmoth cellar. I have not verified that. I carry the pike, gauntlets, boots, her Draught, Eye-Setting, Keystone, gold, poison, sap jar, rapier, Warden Vault Key and Bronze Key. Open: Fort Chalkmoth key and cellar, Ennodius Vanin the Collector.", "result": "Thank you. Your notes are kept; the game is over. You can stop now.", "summary": {"stage": 90, "at": "Guardian's Hall", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true, "flag.mn18.stones-set": true, "flag.mn18.through": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note", "npc.mn.cuts-the-old-knot", "npc.mn.root-guardian"], "heard": ["